 "t": "你好，新朋友",
 "zh": "",
 "en": "Hello, New Friends",
 "icon": "🤝",
 "color": "#E0674F",
 "key": {
  "t": "你姓什么？你叫什么名字？",
  "r": "nǐ xìng shén me? nǐ jiào shén me míng zi?",
  "zh": "",
  "en": "What's your family name, and what are you called?"
 },
 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "zh": "姓 和 叫；也 和 都",
   "en": "Surname and name; 也 and 都"
  },
  "tip": {
   "zh": "「姓」后面只说姓，「叫」后面可以说全名：我姓林，叫林小雨。「也」和「都」要放在动词前面：我也是学生，我们都是学生。两个三声连在一起，前一个读成二声：「你好」写 nǐ hǎo，读 ní hǎo。",
   "en": "姓 (xìng) is followed by the family name only, while 叫 (jiào) can take a full name: 我姓林，叫林小雨 (wǒ xìng Lín, jiào Lín Xiǎo Yǔ). 也 (yě, also) and 都 (dōu, all) go before the verb: 我也是学生 (wǒ yě shì xué sheng). When two third tones meet, the first is said as second tone: 你好 is written nǐ hǎo but said ní hǎo."
  }
 },
